# The build context for apps/worker/Dockerfile. Docker reads this file instead
# of the root .dockerignore because it sits beside the Dockerfile it names, so
# the api and web images (issue 1gffor) can keep contexts of their own.
#
# The workspace packages the worker does not use keep their package.json: a
# filtered `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` still checks every manifest the
# lockfile names.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.git
.venv
.pnpm-store
.beaver
.claude
.agents
.vscode
.vite-hooks
sandbox
apps/web/**
!apps/web/package.json
apps/api/**
!apps/api/package.json
packages/api-client/**
!packages/api-client/package.json
